21
00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:03.270
Simply put Robin is a modern day warrior.

22
00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:06.876
She is fueled by the ethos that there is no finish line.

23
00:01:06.876 --> 00:01:09.850
Her life's mission is to redefine, reform,

24
00:01:09.850 --> 00:01:12.000
