1635
01:00:50.500 --> 01:00:52.150
Because I know a lot of people who are like,

1636
01:00:52.150 --> 01:00:54.156
well, I would do something I was passionate about

1637
01:00:54.156 --> 01:00:55.930
if I knew what I was passionate about.

1638
01:00:55.930 --> 01:00:57.857
Like, I don't even know because, and it's not their fault,

1639
01:00:57.857 --> 01:00:59.980
you know, and I know what that's like,

1640
01:00:59.980 --> 01:01:00.860
I've been in that place.

1641
01:01:00.860 --> 01:01:03.350
I don't, you know, I didn't know what I wanted to do or be

1642
01:01:03.350 --> 01:01:04.767
or what was unique about me at all.

1643
01:01:04.767 --> 01:01:08.040
You know, I was just doing what was in front of me to do.

1644
01:01:08.040 --> 01:01:10.370
And it's very, very difficult, you know?

1645
01:01:10.370 --> 01:01:12.505
So, like, what is the,

1646
01:01:12.505 --> 01:01:15.030
and I'm sure you've encountered lots of people like this,

1647
01:01:15.030 --> 01:01:18.083
so like what is that first step that somebody can do?

1648
01:01:19.020 --> 01:01:20.020
I think...

1649
01:01:21.700 --> 01:01:23.993
Well, actually, one thing.

1650
01:01:25.810 --> 01:01:28.234
I think it's helpful to notice

1651
01:01:28.234 --> 01:01:31.642
when you're jealous of someone because-

1652
01:01:31.642 --> 01:01:34.240
That's really interesting.

1653
01:01:34.240 --> 01:01:38.160
It means they probably have something you want.

1654
01:01:38.160 --> 01:01:41.113
Yeah, jealousy really speaks more about you than,

1655
01:01:41.113 --> 01:01:42.216
it's all about you.

1656
01:01:42.216 --> 01:01:43.049
Yes, yes.

1657
01:01:43.049 --> 01:01:45.480
And I noticed like, I know for me,

1658
01:01:45.480 --> 01:01:48.150
I would look at, you know, people in the fitness movement

1659
01:01:48.150 --> 01:01:49.810
who have made careers out of it,

1660
01:01:49.810 --> 01:01:51.375
and I'm like, man, they get paid for that.

1661
01:01:51.375 --> 01:01:52.583
I wanna get paid for that!

1662
01:01:52.583 --> 01:01:55.999
And it was like this little pang of like desire

1663
01:01:55.999 --> 01:02:00.999
and jealousy, like, and not in like a romantic jealousy way,

1664
01:02:01.150 --> 01:02:04.640
but, you know, in a substantive like, God, I want that,

1665
01:02:04.640 --> 01:02:05.603
like a yearning.

1666
01:02:06.448 --> 01:02:09.380
And we should pay attention to that stuff.

1667
01:02:09.380 --> 01:02:10.990
I think one of the first things

1668
01:02:10.990 --> 01:02:12.830
that we can do is really pay attention

1669
01:02:12.830 --> 01:02:14.350
to our inner monologue.

1670
01:02:14.350 --> 01:02:16.435
And I believe in,

1671
01:02:16.435 --> 01:02:20.793
like most of the things I've done in business,

1672
01:02:22.660 --> 01:02:24.650
it's only been a few years so my journey's just starting,

1673
01:02:24.650 --> 01:02:26.630
but it's all based on a gut check.

1674
01:02:26.630 --> 01:02:31.534
It's like pure am I feeling you or this or not?

1675
01:02:31.534 --> 01:02:34.850
And if it's not, like you're out of my sphere, man.

1676
01:02:34.850 --> 01:02:36.516
Like, I have no time-
But you gotta be,

1677
01:02:36.516 --> 01:02:38.482
you have to be clear before you can trust a gut check.

1678
01:02:38.482 --> 01:02:40.230
Yeah, exactly. So, you have to clear it out.

1679
01:02:40.230 --> 01:02:42.231
And I actually think-

1680
01:02:42.231 --> 01:02:43.540
'Cause your gut check will send you

1681
01:02:43.540 --> 01:02:46.627
