1682
01:02:46.627 --> 01:02:47.710
you know what I mean?

1683
01:02:47.710 --> 01:02:48.543
Very true.

1684
01:02:48.543 --> 01:02:49.760
That gut check could be jealousy.

1685
01:02:49.760 --> 01:02:51.726
Like, you're confusing these conflicting emotions.

1686
01:02:51.726 --> 01:02:53.059
Right, right, right, absolutely.

1687
01:02:53.059 --> 01:02:56.888
Well, one thing that has helped me is meditation.

1688
01:02:56.888 --> 01:02:57.721
I practice-

