01:02:57.721 --> 01:02:59.869
This is what I was driving at anyway.

1690
01:02:59.869 --> 01:03:02.560
Okay, I'm with you.

1691
01:03:02.560 --> 01:03:06.270
So, I dabbled in so many types of meditation, man.

1692
01:03:06.270 --> 01:03:10.080
I mean, like, it's super,

1693
01:03:10.080 --> 01:03:11.527
it was super, super, super hard for me.

1694
01:03:11.527 --> 01:03:14.000
Like, that's not my natural frequency.

1695
01:03:14.000 --> 01:03:14.880
Like, I'm not like-

1696
01:03:14.880 --> 01:03:15.998
Yeah, you're vibrating at two,

