1705
01:03:42.210 --> 01:03:45.430
So, I went to this like little course with this guy,

1706
01:03:45.430 --> 01:03:47.230
actually a former attorney who I used to work with

1707
01:03:47.230 --> 01:03:50.500
who's now a meditation guru, Ben Turshen.

1708
01:03:50.500 --> 01:03:54.630
And Ben gave me my mantra, and that's it.

1709
01:03:54.630 --> 01:03:56.782
I mean, it was like having that focal point,

1710
01:03:56.782 --> 01:03:59.390
having that like instrument for thinking,

1711
01:03:59.390 --> 01:04:01.563
which is literally what a mantra means,

1712
01:04:02.720 --> 01:04:05.440
let me suspend all this other stuff.

1713
01:04:05.440 --> 01:04:08.061
Not like I think this mantra and no thoughts come in.

1714
01:04:08.061 --> 01:04:10.647
I think that's the cool thing about this type of meditation

1715
01:04:10.647 --> 01:04:14.450
that works for me is that like you allow the thoughts

1716
01:04:14.450 --> 01:04:15.283
and then let them go.

1717
01:04:15.283 --> 01:04:18.910
And then it's just like this passing thing.

1718
01:04:18.910 --> 01:04:23.500
And somehow there's like,

1719
01:04:23.500 --> 01:04:28.240
I carve out like this white noise in those 20 minutes

1720
01:04:28.240 --> 01:04:31.770
and it works for me, man.

1721
01:04:31.770 --> 01:04:32.820
It just totally works.

1722
01:04:32.820 --> 01:04:34.107
