1727
01:04:41.130 --> 01:04:43.170
like a dedicated TM practice.

1728
01:04:43.170 --> 01:04:45.780
Like, morning and you're hitting it like every day,

1729
01:04:45.780 --> 01:04:47.198
20 minutes in the morning and 20 minutes-

1730
01:04:47.198 --> 01:04:48.031
Yeah, yeah.

1731
01:04:48.031 --> 01:04:50.780
