1800
01:07:12.353 --> 01:07:14.739
and I'd stick in my headphones and I don't play anything,

1801
01:07:14.739 --> 01:07:16.748
but it's almost like just the people blocker.

1802
01:07:16.748 --> 01:07:18.456
(Robin laughs)

1803
01:07:18.456 --> 01:07:22.234
And yeah, I mean, you just, it's a portable thing.

1804
01:07:22.234 --> 01:07:23.734
You just need you.

1805
01:07:25.067 --> 01:07:26.169
Yeah, and I mean, I think that

1806
01:07:26.169 --> 01:07:28.382
if you're not kind of looking inward in that way,

1807
01:07:28.382 --> 01:07:31.633
then when you're asking yourself these important questions,

1808
01:07:31.633 --> 01:07:33.340
like what should I do with my life?

1809
01:07:33.340 --> 01:07:34.483
Where do I want to invest all?

1810
01:07:34.483 --> 01:07:35.780
I mean, these are huge questions

1811
01:07:35.780 --> 01:07:37.415
